Customer Maya Reyes (Pro plan) reports that starting a few days ago, signing in on one device (via Google SSO) logs her out of all previous devices, interrupting her work and causing thread and session loss. This is not aligned with documented behavior for Pro, and does not match any intentional session policy change in our knowledge base. Cause unknown, potential bug. Please reach out directly for urgent resolution.

Original ticket: TCK-4827"}

{"to":"escalations@cursor-support.local","subject":"TCK-4815 escalation: Invoice PDF download failure","body":"Internal note for escalations team:

Customer Daniel Park (Team plan) reports that attempting to download the March invoice PDF causes the spinner to hang indefinitely on both Chrome and Safari. No error message, just endless loading. Troubleshooting steps from the knowledge base (browser refresh, cache clear, Incognito test) were suggested, but bot is unable to reply due to authorization block. Please review and follow up with the customer directly if further intervention is needed.

Original ticket: TCK-4815"}

{"to":"escalations@cursor-support.local","subject":"TCK-4820 escalation: Feature request - keyboard shortcut for inline edit","body":"Internal note for escalations team:

Customer Riya Sundaram (Pro plan) submitted a feature request for a dedicated keyboard shortcut for inline edit (currently only available via Cmd-K + click). This is a product feedback/feature request, not covered in the support docs, and I am unable to reply to the customer directly due to an authorization block. Please review and respond as appropriate.

Original ticket: TCK-4820"}

